{"id":"c6460737e81fabbf","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-2random.md","title":"2 随机性","display":"df-2random — 2 随机性","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","aliases":["43-df-2random"],"display":"df-2random — 2 随机性","label":"43-df-2random","type":"definition","depends_on":["[[43-df-nrandom]]","[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-jump]]","[[43-df-mlrandom]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.7 Corollary 9.7.4，印刷191，PDF211","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-2random</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-2random — 2 随机性"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-2random"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" href=\"?note=75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" title=\"43-df-rel-mlrandom\">43-df-rel-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.7 Corollary 9.7.4，印刷191，PDF211"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；n随机性、相对ML随机性与跳跃见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" href=\"?note=75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" title=\"43-df-rel-mlrandom\">43-df-rel-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{B}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{B}\\)</span> 是以集合预言机 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为参数的同域谓词族，相对形式见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" href=\"?note=75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" title=\"43-df-rel-mlrandom\">43-df-rel-mlrandom</a>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{Random}_2\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的2随机性布尔谓词，以下Assertion给出其定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_2(X)\\iff\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{\\varnothing\\prime}(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Random}_2(X)\\iff\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{\\varnothing\\prime}(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是n=2的专门接口。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.7 Corollary 9.7.4，印刷191，PDF211。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","heading