om]] 中的二随机谓词；$\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}$、$\\Omega_U^A$ 见 [[43-df-omega-operator]]。"},{"id":"b87b214a01dffde2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$C$ 是固定最优普通复杂度（see [[43-df-kolm]]），$\\mathrm{Random}_2$ 见 [[43-df-2random]]。"},{"id":"716a4678ad674a84","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；定义见 [[43-df-2random]]、[[43-df-weak2random]]。"},{"id":"28dbc431d5ab401c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$S_n$ 为下式定义的对称随机游走部分和，$\\log$ 是自然对数，极限从 $n\\ge3$ 取。随机性谓词见 [[43-df-2random]]。"},{"id":"dcf20c6e2ba26931","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\in2^\\omega$ 且 $\\mathrm{MLRandom}(A)$；见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-lowforomega]]、[[43-df-2random]]。"}],"outgoing":["86bdc33f83ee57a9","75e7e3b6eeecc95e","b3936ae4c5d2dc79","0586e0fd0301d605"]}